govenv-project-purpose-snapshot-v2
review-index 1
review-rationale "Review of the complete resulting roadmap after GV121 found the purpose unchanged: P7 keeps language-neutral applications downstream of the same self-governing environment model, and the deferred Agda formatter/linter is an external application rather than a new core purpose."
purpose "Turn every repository into a self-governing developer environment: define what valid means once, let agents move fast without outrunning human authority, and reproduce the same tooling, automation, and runtime anywhere."
